e believed in duty above all else. Lucian believes in Lance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the truth behind his brother's disappearance unravels, you'll face questions the game doesn't answer for you. Strength won't be enough. Neither will hope. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/3a254184fdadffee19f9194586bedf75.poster.avif?t=1784654801\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/3a254184fdadffee19f9194586bedf75.webm?t=1784654801\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/3a254184fdadffee19f9194586bedf75.mp4?t=1784654801\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/extras/19800ae6c19ee943481d1b8650e9c51c.avif?t=1784654801\" width=800 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>How far will you go to bring him back?</i> </p>", "short_description": "Your brother is corrupted. The Blight is spreading. Only you can stop it. Colossus is an atmospheric pixel action-adventure where you master precise combat, explore a vast dark fantasy world, and make choices that permanently scar the kingdom of Eireos.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1722800/5869d676721fab8c0407f7a1681698f785ae3400/header.jpg?t=1784654801", "capsule_image": "https://shared